; The same Earth-and-alien-traffic backdrop the briefing and quiz use, so the
; kiosk's first screen already shows what the game is about — and so an idle
; screen has something moving on it. Its own Earth photograph is turned off
; here: the attract cycle above is already showing a world, and two of them
; stacked read as fog.
[node name="SpaceBackdrop" parent="." instance=ExtResource("2")]
